OL,3,GNEWSAShops seeing 'teens and little old
OL,4,Aladies' steal
OL,5,
OL,6,FShops on a street dealing with
OL,7,Fshoplifting from "teenagers to little
OL,8,Fold ladies" is struggling to cope, say
OL,9,Fbusiness owners.
OL,11,FItems ranging from wallpaper to
OL,12,Fmemorial ornaments have been stolen
OL,13,Ffrom shops on Sunderland's Chester
OL,14,FRoad.
OL,16,FNigel Marston, who co-runs Jayne Prior
OL,17,FFuneral Directors, said the cost of
OL,18,Fliving had pushed people into crime and
OL,19,Fbusinesses were reluctant to report
OL,20,Fthem due to a perceived lack of action.
